			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 140030101,
					"content": "不好意思，夏洛蒂小姐。今天我和妹妹有點忙，暫時不接受採訪…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030102,
					"content": "放心，我只會佔用一點點時間——拜託了，林尼先生！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏洛蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030103,
					"content": "咦，發生什麼事了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030104,
					"content": "我原本通宵寫好了關於怪盜貂的專欄，今天早上就可以登報發表了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏洛蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030105,
					"content": "但是——就在凌晨的時候，我突然獲知消息，塞薩爾的未婚妻嘉瑪主動聯絡了警備隊，承認她才是真正的怪盜貂！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏洛蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030106,
					"content": "這麼快！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030107,
					"content": "咳。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030108,
					"content": "嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏洛蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030109,
					"content": "已經來不及了，哥哥。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳妮特"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030110,
					"content": "#呵呵…{F#妳}{M#你}們的第一反應是「這麼快」，看來已經提前知道真相了啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏洛蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030111,
					"content": "啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030112,
					"content": "果然我的直覺是對的，你們絕對有什麼事瞞著我！嘉瑪投案自首的原因…一定跟昨晚林尼先生的魔術表演有關！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏洛蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030113,
					"content": "可能是嘉瑪小姐看到高空逃生魔術後，回憶起和塞薩爾共度的時光，良心發現了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030114,
					"content": "原來如此——不對啊，要是這麼簡單就良心發現，這十年她做了什麼了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏洛蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030115,
					"content": "這個嘛…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030116,
					"content": "（感覺夏洛蒂的記者之魂正在熊熊燃燒，得想辦法引開她的注意力…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030117
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140030117,
					"content": "我想起來了！昨天的魔術表演後，你們和嘉瑪都不見了。難道說就是那個時候？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏洛蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030118,
					"content": "#突擊採訪，請問表演完{F#妳}{M#你}們去哪裡了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏洛蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030119,
					"content": "魔術表演完？我們和林尼在墓園，林尼還為我們單獨表演了魔術呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030120,
					"content": "說起來，多虧了妳的提醒，現在林尼變魔術已經會用「虹彩薔薇」啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030121,
					"content": "咳…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030122,
					"content": "…嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳妮特"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030123,
					"content": "#印象裡就連我也沒有收到過哥哥送的虹彩薔薇。所以哥哥的意思是，{M#他們}{F#她們}比我更重要嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳妮特"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030124,
					"content": "不是啦！這個…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030125,
					"content": "怎、怎麼連妳也是這個反應，我又說錯話了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030126,
					"content": "#氣氛好像變得很奇怪…{NICKNAME}，我們現在該怎麼辦啊？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030127,
					"content": "唉，看來今天好像不太適合採訪。好吧，那我下次再來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏洛蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030128,
					"content": "請原諒我的固執，但我不會對這麼勁爆的消息坐視不理！嘉瑪的事情一經傳開就引起了巨大轟動，我要全力挖出這背後的真相！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏洛蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030129,
					"content": "聽說她還對警備隊講了「最後的心願是希望再見洛倫佐一面」。唉…好複雜的關係，真讓人好奇。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏洛蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030130,
					"content": "總之我先走了。你們慢慢聊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030131
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏洛蒂"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030131,
					"content": "呃，琳妮特，其實…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030132
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030132,
					"content": "沒關係，我並沒有生氣，剛剛只是為了轉移她的注意。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030133
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳妮特"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030133,
					"content": "原來是這樣，嚇我一跳。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030134
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030134,
					"content": "呼，連我也差點被騙到了…好在效果不錯，對吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030135
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030135,
					"content": "…虹彩薔薇，請好好保管。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140030136
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳妮特"
				},
				{
					"id": 140030136,
					"content": "如果弄丟了的話，我也會感到難過的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "琳妮特"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}